The extreme cold is destroying the crops. If this goes on, the people will be at risk.
Zarad reported that the bottom of the sea is freezing and that a river of glacial lava has begun to flow toward the continent, like the one that started running from Gallubia Valley. Creatures it touches die or are reborn as ice warriors.

We must stop this sudden drop in temperature and the course of this river.

Please, find Ruby, the Fire Priestess.
